  "description": "<p>This task is to update fcrepo4 logic to filter out what is exposed to the user as \"fedora:mimeType\".</p>\n\n<p>Currently, after running the following steps, \"fedora:mimeType\" still exists:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>Start a 4.2.0 fcrepo and add a binary resource</li>\n\t<li>Run the fcrepo4-upgrade-utility over that repository</li>\n\t<li>Start master branch of fcrepo =&gt; see fedora:mimeType still exists</li>\n</ul>\n",
